{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Nareko  $Okina  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The pyramid of the Sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems to be a facility of the Lunar Capital called the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In reality, it was a shrine dedicated to the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Nareko  >What? This pyramid is actually a Lunarian facility?"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Not only that, they said it also connects to the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Nareko  >That's incredible. What a great responsibility for a dosoujin."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >By the way, you mentioned you're here to keep things from coming out right?"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If this is a Lunarian facility, I'm wondering who could've positioned you here while knowing that."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Nareko  >The one who put me here? Hmmm."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >That is something I"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did not do, but, I must commend the one who did on a job well done."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is a crucial place for Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh? You!?"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Nareko  >Ah, since when was she behind me!?"
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Okina!"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you here?"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >I was looking into Gensokyo's incident."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I couldn't have imagined the cause was from the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh? It was the Lunarians though."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >Can you really call yourself a shrine maiden?"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't seem like you understand what happened."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Uhhh, well, yeah."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >The direct cause of the incident was the goddess of unchanging enshrined inside this pyramid, Ariya Iwanaga."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, this was only because the Lunarians asked her to, she wasn't too keen on causing the incident."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So she secretly lured a human to stop her."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >As for why she was released in the first place,"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was to prevent the Lunar Capital from being engulfed by the violent stream of information and change."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was something only she, the goddess of unchanging could do."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then there's the main cause for that surge of information and change..."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >Which is the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hold on a moment, too much information!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >That's right, the main cause was the overflowing amount of information from the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "43_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >How do you know so much about this?",
                "<l$> Don't tell me you're behind everything again?"
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Nareko  >Wait, again?"
            ]
        },
        "45_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >Why, of course. Is what I'd like to say but you're mistaken."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >I only know so much because I saw it with you, obviously."
            ]
        },
        "47_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "48_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Okina  >I put a backdoor on that Incident Stone."
            ]
        },
        "49_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I saw everything with you."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Ugh, you're the worst!"
            ]
        },
        "51_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Similar to Reimu, it seems that Okina was also investigating the incident."
            ]
        },
        "52_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems that the incident didn't affect Okina, as she lived in a world separate from Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "53_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Her simple summary of the incident brought a feeling of reassurance."
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But at the same time, it also looked like she understood the gist of the incident since the beginning."
            ]
        },
        "55_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If the cause of the mess were the Lunar Capital and the Outside World, is there anything the people of Gensokyo can do?"
            ]
        },
        "57_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending　No.04　Quick Talking Matara$>"
            ]
        },
        "56_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That uneasy thought crossed Reimu's mind."
            ]
        }
    }
}